# Local Worker dev overrides for `wrangler dev` (copy to `.dev.vars`).
# setlist.fm has NO app-level API credentials — each user's own setlist.fm API
# key arrives through the connector's OAuth login form, not from here. The vars
# below are optional and mirror the toggles the stdio server honors.

# Localize city/country names in setlist.fm responses (e.g. "de", "es").
# SETLIST_ACCEPT_LANGUAGE=en
